{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014C51pZqQ65GuHJgRbP2XvF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each experiment in the experiment plan, under the \"worst\" tier scenario. I need to provide specific metric predictions with rationales explaining why these results would occur under the worst-case assumptions.\n\nLet me carefully go through each experiment and predict what would happen under the worst tier definition:\n\n**Worst tier meaning:**\n- Core bias mechanism not significant on real LLM data\n- EC-HTE has no clear advantage over simple baselines\n- Key metric ranges provided\n\nLet me work through each experiment systematically.\n\n**exp-001: HB EC-HTE on synthetic data**\n\n\nUnder worst case, hierarchical Bayes shows minimal improvement over maximum likelihood estimation, with RMSE reduction hovering near zero, while coverage drops to the lower end of acceptable ranges. The partial pooling mechanism fails to provide meaningful value in this scenario.\n\n**exp-002: Formal bias bound verification**\nThe analytic bounds become increasingly loose as group counts rise, explaining only moderate variance in the data, while bias amplification stays within modest multiples of the baseline rather than showing dramatic effects. The interaction term between treatment and outcome heterogeneity doesn't translate well to realistic settings.\n\n**exp-003: Semi-synthetic benchmark**\nReal LLM misclassification patterns show limited heterogeneity across subgroups, causing EC-HTE to struggle with identifying meaningful treatment effect variations.\n\n**exp-004: Real data (Ashwin et al.)**\nHeterogeneity is present but small enough that EC-HTE improvements remain marginal, and global bias correction doesn't substantially degrade performance.\n\n**exp-005: Diagnostic criterion**\nThe AUC for detecting heterogeneity falls short of reliability thresholds.\n\n**exp-006: Expert budget sensitivity**\nThe sample size needed to see HB benefits is prohibitively high, making the approach impractical at smaller scales.\n\n**exp-007: PPCI comparison**\nPPCI handles covariate-error confounding partially, though the distinction from EC-HTE remains unclear.\n\n**exp-008: Multi-LLM comparison**\nHeterogeneity varies across models but stays modest overall.\n\n**exp-009: Adaptive allocation**\nThis direction shows some promise.\n\n**exp-010: Robustness**\nThe method's performance suffers when subgroup specifications are misaligned with the true structure.\n\n**exp-011: Causal forest integration**\nAnother potentially promising avenue worth exploring.\n\nNow I'm moving toward synthesizing these findings into a structured YAML summary.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10316,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10316},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d2bdcbf-6297-4483-8c11-07e563a25463","uuid":"589a4166-2a88-4035-a243-c08c13057831"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_014C51pZqQ65GuHJgRbP2XvF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  放弃 \"bias mechanism is practically consequential\" 的强叙事。核心发现：当前主流 LLM 在 typical CSS 任务上\n  misclassification heterogeneity 有限（max/min ratio 多在 1.05–1.15），global correction 的额外 bias\n  通常 < 2x，不构成实际危害。转向 Angle A（negative/cautionary result）：首次形式化了 \"何时需要担心\" 的条件，\n  证明当前 LLM 多数情况下不触发，这本身有理论和实践价值。备选 pivot：若 exp-008 找到某个 LLM/domain 组合确实\n  触发显著 heterogeneity，以 case study 挽救叙事；若 exp-009 或 exp-011 意外表现好，pivot 到 adaptive\n  allocation 或 causal forest integration 作为主贡献。关键操作：exp-010（robustness）和 exp-008（multi-LLM）\n  提升优先级，寻找触发条件；将 analytic bound 从 \"tight characterization\" 降级为 \"conservative sufficient\n  condition\"；论文标题改为问句形式（\"When Does Subgroup-Stratified Correction Matter for LLM-Annotated HTE?\"）。\n  仍冲 EMNLP main CL+CSS track，但需 8 页中拿出 1.5 页做 characterization + negative result 的 framing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"HB EC-HTE Synthetic Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      HB Dirichlet partial pooling vs MLE/Laplace stratified correction，\n      full regime sweep (extreme/moderate/homogeneous × n_expert 100–2000 × K=2,4)。\n    expected_results:\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_extreme_k2_n250: -0.02\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_extreme_k2_n1000: -0.01\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_moderate_k2_n250: 0.00\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_moderate_k4_n250: 0.03\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_homogeneous_k2_n250: 0.01\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n250: 0.86\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n1000: 0.91\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_k2_n250: 0.84\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_k4_n250: 0.83\n      hb_coverage_95ci_homogeneous_k2_n250: 0.88\n      mle_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n250: 0.82\n      mle_coverage_95ci_moderate_k4_n250: 0.79\n      partial_pooling_shrinkage_factor_moderate_k4: 0.65\n      mcmc_rhat_max: 1.003\n      mcmc_ess_min: 280\n      mcmc_runtime_vs_mle_ratio: 45.0\n      mc_runs: 1000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 HB 与 MLE stratified 差异不显著。原因：partial pooling 的价值在于 borrowing strength\n      across subgroups，但当 heterogeneity 本身不大时，MLE stratified 估计已经足够准确，Dirichlet prior\n      的 shrinkage 几乎无事可做。在 extreme regime（人造的 5x+ heterogeneity）下 HB 略优（RMSE 降 2%），\n      但这个 regime 在 realistic 数据上不出现。moderate regime 下差异 < 1%。K=4 时 HB 反而略差（+3%），\n      因为 Dirichlet 的 4×4 confusion matrix 参数空间更大，prior 选择更敏感，且 n_expert=250 时\n      每 cell 样本不足。Coverage 系统性偏低（83–88%），源于 confusion matrix 估计的 sampling\n      uncertainty 未被充分传播到 CATE CI 中——posterior predictive intervals 低估了矩阵逆运算\n      中的 error propagation。MCMC 收敛良好但 runtime 是 MLE 的 45 倍，reviewer 会质疑实用性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: HB vs MLE Stratified — RMSE and Coverage by Regime\"\n        columns: [regime, K, n_expert, rmse_hb, rmse_mle, rmse_diff_pct, coverage_hb, coverage_mle]\n        rows:\n          - [extreme, 2, 250, 0.041, 0.042, \"-2.4%\", 0.86, 0.82]\n          - [extreme, 2, 1000, 0.022, 0.022, \"-1.0%\", 0.91, 0.89]\n          - [extreme, 4, 250, 0.058, 0.055, \"+5.5%\", 0.83, 0.80]\n          - [moderate, 2, 250, 0.035, 0.035, \"0.0%\", 0.84, 0.83]\n          - [moderate, 2, 1000, 0.019, 0.019, \"0.0%\", 0.90, 0.89]\n          - [moderate, 4, 250, 0.049, 0.048, \"+2.1%\", 0.83, 0.79]\n          - [homogeneous, 2, 250, 0.030, 0.030, \"+1.0%\", 0.88, 0.87]\n          - [homogeneous, 4, 250, 0.038, 0.037, \"+2.7%\", 0.85, 0.84]\n      - title: \"Table 2: MCMC Diagnostics Summary\"\n        columns: [parameter_group, rhat_median, rhat_max, ess_bulk_min, ess_tail_min, runtime_sec]\n        rows:\n          - [confusion_matrix_k2, 1.001, 1.003, 450, 280, 42]\n          - [confusion_matrix_k4, 1.002, 1.005, 320, 210, 185]\n          - [cate_posterior_k2, 1.001, 1.002, 520, 310, \"-\"]\n          - [cate_posterior_k4, 1.002, 1.004, 380, 240, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: HB vs MLE RMSE difference with 95% CI across all regimes. 大多数 CI 跨零，仅 extreme/K=2 显著。\"\n      - \"Coverage calibration plot: nominal 95% vs actual coverage by regime. 系统性低于 nominal line，K=4 更严重。\"\n    analysis: >\n      HB partial pooling 在 worst 档下不是 selling point。extreme regime 的微弱优势无法外推到\n      realistic 数据。Coverage 偏低是结构性问题——需要 bootstrap 或 sandwich variance 补救，\n      但这会进一步增加计算成本。论文中应诚实报告 HB 的边际价值有限，将贡献重心转向 bias mechanism\n      的 characterization 而非 estimation method。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bias Bound Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      解析推导 bias = f(Δπ, Δτ)，K=2 和 K>2 两种情况。\n      MC 验证 analytic prediction vs empirical bias 的 R²。\n    expected_results:\n      analytic_r_squared_k2: 0.92\n      analytic_r_squared_k4: 0.68\n      analytic_r_squared_k8: 0.52\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k2: 1.15\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k4: 2.30\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k8: 3.80\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p05: 1.08\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p10: 1.18\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p20: 1.45\n      bias_amplification_at_extreme_delta_pi_0p40: 3.20\n      debiasing_hurts_threshold_delta_pi: 0.08\n      mc_ci_width_bias_estimate: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      K=2 时 Δπ×Δτ 形式是 exact（R²=0.92，残差来自 finite-sample noise），因为二分类 confusion\n      matrix 只有一个自由度，bias 表达式可以 closed-form 展开。但 K>2 时 confusion matrix 是\n      K×K，交叉项爆炸——K=4 有 12 个 off-diagonal 元素，Δπ×Δτ 的简单乘积形式只是 first-order\n      approximation，忽略了 cross-subgroup misclassification 的高阶交互。R² 从 0.92（K=2）\n      降到 0.68（K=4）再到 0.52（K=8），bound 变得越来越松（tightness ratio 从 1.15 到 3.8）。\n      在 realistic Δπ 范围（0.05–0.10，对应 LLM 在不同 subgroup 间 5–10pp 的 accuracy 差异），\n      bias amplification 仅 1.08–1.18x，不构成实际危害。只有在 Δπ≥0.20 时才开始显著（1.45x），\n      而这个水平在当前 LLM 上很少见。\"Debiasing can hurt\" 的 threshold 虽然存在（Δπ≈0.08），\n      但 hurt 的程度很小。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 3: Analytic Bound Accuracy by K\"\n        columns: [K, r_squared, bound_tightness_ratio, n_mc_runs]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 0.92, 1.15, 1000]\n          - [4, 0.68, 2.30, 1000]\n          - [8, 0.52, 3.80, 500]\n      - title: \"Table 4: Bias Amplification (Global/No-Correction) by Δπ\"\n        columns: [delta_pi, delta_tau, bias_amplification_k2, bias_amplification_k4]\n        rows:\n          - [0.05, 0.3, 1.08, 1.12]\n          - [0.10, 0.3, 1.18, 1.25]\n          - [0.20, 0.3, 1.45, 1.62]\n          - [0.40, 0.3, 3.20, 4.10]\n          - [0.05, 0.6, 1.15, 1.20]\n          - [0.10, 0.6, 1.35, 1.48]\n          - [0.20, 0.6, 2.10, 2.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: Δπ (x-axis) × Δτ (y-axis)，color = bias amplification ratio。realistic region（Δπ<0.15, Δτ<0.4）颜色浅（<1.5x），仅右上角极端区域显著。\"\n      - \"Scatter: analytic predicted bias vs MC observed bias，K=2 紧密聚集在 y=x，K=4 散点明显偏离，K=8 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δπ×Δτ bound 在 K=2 时优雅且 tight，但 generalization 到 K>2 失败——这是 worst 档的\n      核心问题。论文不能宣称 \"通用诊断准则\"，只能说 \"K=2 的 exact characterization + K>2 的\n      conservative sufficient condition\"。Realistic parameter 区间内 bias amplification 太小，\n      \"debiasing can hurt by 5–10x\" 的 headline 只在人造 extreme regime 成立。需要 reframe：\n      \"我们证明了在何种条件下问题才会严重，并发现当前 LLM 通常不触发这些条件。\"\n\n  - name: \"Semi-Synthetic Benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      Real tweet corpus + injected CATE structure + GPT-4.1/Qwen3-235B 标注。\n      测量 real misclassification heterogeneity，EC-HTE vs global vs no-correction。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.12\n      qwen3_misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.18\n      gpt4_overall_accuracy: 0.88\n      qwen3_overall_accuracy: 0.82\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_reduction_vs_global_gpt4: 0.25\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_reduction_vs_global_qwen3: 0.40\n      global_vs_nocorrection_bias_amplification_gpt4: 1.05\n      global_vs_nocorrection_bias_amplification_qwen3: 1.12\n      ec_hte_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.87\n      ec_hte_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.85\n      global_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.85\n      global_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.82\n      nocorrection_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.78\n      nocorrection_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.74\n      max_subgroup_bias_global_gpt4: 0.015\n      max_subgroup_bias_global_qwen3: 0.028\n      max_subgroup_bias_echte_gpt4: 0.011\n      max_subgroup_bias_echte_qwen3: 0.017\n    result_rationale: >\n      Real LLM 数据上 misclassification heterogeneity 远低于 synthetic extreme regime。\n      GPT-4.1 accuracy 高（88%）且跨 subgroup 差异小（max/min ratio 1.12），因为 frontier LLM\n      在 political text 分类上已经足够好，不同 subgroup 的语言难度差异被模型能力压平。Qwen3 稍差\n      （82%, ratio 1.18），但仍远低于 \"5x\" 的 extreme 设定。结果：global correction 几乎不 hurt\n      （amplification 1.05–1.12x），EC-HTE 的 bias reduction 有但幅度小（25–40%），绝对 bias\n      差异在 0.004–0.011 之间——统计上可能显著但实际上微不足道。Coverage 偏低延续了 exp-001 的\n      pattern。这个结果直接动摇 Claim 1 的 \"practically consequential\" 部分。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 5: Misclassification Heterogeneity — Real LLM on Semi-Synthetic Data\"\n        columns: [llm, overall_acc, subgroup_acc_min, subgroup_acc_max, max_min_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4.1, 0.88, 0.86, 0.90, 1.12]\n          - [Qwen3-235B, 0.82, 0.78, 0.86, 1.18]\n      - title: \"Table 6: Subgroup CATE Bias (Max Across Subgroups)\"\n        columns: [method, gpt4_max_bias, gpt4_mean_bias, qwen3_max_bias, qwen3_mean_bias]\n        rows:\n          - [No Correction, 0.025, 0.018, 0.042, 0.030]\n          - [Global Correction, 0.015, 0.010, 0.028, 0.019]\n          - [EC-HTE (MLE), 0.012, 0.008, 0.018, 0.012]\n          - [EC-HTE (HB), 0.011, 0.008, 0.017, 0.011]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: subgroup-level bias by method × LLM。差异可见但绝对值都很小。需要 zoom-in panel 才能看到差异。\"\n      - \"Misclassification rate heatmap by subgroup × LLM。颜色变化平缓，heterogeneity 视觉上不突出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic 结果是 worst 档叙事的核心证据：real LLM 的 misclassification heterogeneity\n      不足以让 global correction 失效。EC-HTE 有微弱优势但 \"insurance, not necessity\"。\n      论文 framing 必须转向 Angle A：\"好消息是当前 LLM 通常不触发这个问题\"。\n      Qwen3 比 GPT-4.1 heterogeneity 略大，暗示 weaker LLMs 可能在某些 domain 触发——\n      这为 exp-008 寻找 stronger case 提供方向。\n\n  - name: \"Ashwin et al. Real-Data Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      Rohingya refugee interview 数据，LLM 标注 error 与 refugee status/gender/education 相关。\n      EC-HTE vs global correction on real CATEs。\n    expected_results:\n      misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.22\n      ec_hte_cate_shift_vs_global_max_subgroup: 0.035\n      ec_hte_cate_shift_vs_global_mean: 0.018\n      ec_hte_coverage: 0.86\n      global_coverage: 0.83\n      nocorrection_coverage: 0.76\n      bias_amplification_global_vs_nocorrection: 1.15\n      qualitative_conclusion_changes: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ashwin et al. 数据的优势是 known demographic-correlated error，但 refugee interview text\n      的 LLM 分类难度差异（按 refugee status/gender）可能只是 moderate。max/min ratio 1.22 比\n      semi-synthetic 高一些（因为 code-switching、方言、文化特定表达确实影响 LLM），但仍不到\n      dramatic 的程度。EC-HTE 的 CATE 调整量（0.035）虽然比 semi-synthetic 大，但没有改变任何\n      subgroup 的 qualitative conclusion（即哪个 subgroup 的 treatment effect 更大的排序不变）。\n      这意味着 EC-HTE 在实际决策层面没有 impact。Coverage 稍好于 semi-synthetic 但仍低于 nominal。\n      无 ground truth CATE 导致无法计算 bias——只能报告 \"correction shift\"，reviewer 可能质疑\n      这是 improvement 还是 overcorrection。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 7: Ashwin et al. — Misclassification by Subgroup\"\n        columns: [subgroup, n, llm_accuracy, accuracy_se]\n        rows:\n          - [female_refugee, 420, 0.78, 0.020]\n          - [male_refugee, 380, 0.82, 0.020]\n          - [female_host, 350, 0.88, 0.017]\n          - [male_host, 310, 0.90, 0.017]\n      - title: \"Table 8: CATE Estimates by Method\"\n        columns: [subgroup, cate_nocorr, cate_global, cate_echte, shift_global_to_echte]\n        rows:\n          - [female_refugee, 0.142, 0.158, 0.172, 0.014]\n          - [male_refugee, 0.118, 0.131, 0.138, 0.007]\n          - [female_host, 0.085, 0.094, 0.090, -0.004]\n          - [male_host, 0.062, 0.069, 0.065, -0.004]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Point-range plot: CATE estimates with 95% CI by method per subgroup。CI 大量重叠，shift 在 CI 内。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Real data 上 EC-HTE 有方向性的 correction 但幅度不足以改变结论。没有 ground truth 是致命\n      弱点——无法证明 EC-HTE 更接近 truth 还是引入了 overcorrection。论文只能定性地论证\n      \"stratified correction 的方向与 known error patterns 一致\"。作为 supporting evidence\n      可以放在论文中，但不能作为 standalone claim 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Criterion Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Δπ×Δτ product 作为 diagnostic，ROC 分析预测 \"global correction harmful\" 的准确性。\n    expected_results:\n      diagnostic_auc_k2: 0.74\n      diagnostic_auc_k4: 0.65\n      diagnostic_auc_overall: 0.70\n      optimal_threshold_delta_pi_times_delta_tau: 0.025\n      sensitivity_at_fpr_0p10: 0.52\n      specificity_at_tpr_0p90: 0.35\n      fraction_settings_where_global_harmful: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Diagnostic AUC 受限于两个因素。(1) \"Global correction harmful\" 的 base rate 低（仅 18%\n      的 settings 触发），因为 realistic parameter 空间中 Δπ 和 Δτ 都倾向于小值——大多数时候\n      global correction 是 fine 的。低 base rate 让 classifier 难以 distinguish。(2) K>2 时\n      Δπ×Δτ 本身就不是好的 summary statistic（exp-002 已证明），sum-of-products 形式有 information\n      loss。AUC=0.70 意味着 diagnostic 比随机好但远不够 reliable——sensitivity 和 specificity\n      无法同时高。作为 \"practical tool\" 推荐给用户是勉强的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 9: Diagnostic ROC Summary\"\n        columns: [setting, auc, sensitivity_at_fpr10, specificity_at_tpr90, n_settings]\n        rows:\n          - [K=2 synthetic, 0.74, 0.58, 0.42, 500]\n          - [K=4 synthetic, 0.65, 0.45, 0.28, 500]\n          - [semi-synthetic (GPT-4.1), 0.71, 0.50, 0.33, 100]\n          - [semi-synthetic (Qwen3), 0.73, 0.55, 0.38, 100]\n          - [overall, 0.70, 0.52, 0.35, 1200]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves by K value。K=2 曲线偏离 diagonal 但远未达到左上角。K=4 接近 diagonal。\"\n      - \"Calibration plot: predicted probability vs actual fraction where global harmful。underconfident in middle range。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUC < 0.75 意味着 Claim 3（diagnostic criterion）作为 standalone contribution 失败。\n      不能推荐给 practitioners 说 \"用这个判断是否需要 stratified correction\"。但问题的 formalization\n      本身仍有价值——\"什么情况下应该担心\" 的问题此前无人提出。论文中 reframe 为 \"we provide a\n      conservative sufficient condition, not a precise diagnostic\"：如果 Δπ×Δτ > threshold，\n      一定要用 stratified；如果 < threshold，大概率 safe 但不保证。这在 Angle A 叙事下 work。\n\n  - name: \"Expert Label Budget Sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      n_expert sweep {50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2000} × K ∈ {2, 4, 8}，\n      找 EC-HTE > Global 的 crossover point。\n    expected_results:\n      crossover_n_k2_moderate: 750\n      crossover_n_k4_moderate: \"never (within 2000)\"\n      crossover_n_k2_extreme: 350\n      crossover_n_k8_moderate: \"never (within 2000)\"\n      hb_advantage_at_n250_k2_moderate_rmse_pct: -1.5\n      hb_advantage_at_n250_k4_moderate_rmse_pct: +4.0\n      hb_advantage_at_n1000_k2_moderate_rmse_pct: -0.5\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.095\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n100_k2: 0.068\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n2000_k2: 0.018\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.052\n      global_rmse_at_n2000_k2: 0.019\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover point 高（500–1000 range）因为 EC-HTE 需要足够 per-subgroup expert labels 来\n      估计 K×K confusion matrix——K=2 时每个 cell 需要 ~50 个 labels 才 stable，意味着总共需要\n      ~200+。但在 moderate heterogeneity 下 global 的 bias 很小，EC-HTE 的 variance cost（来自\n      subgroup-level estimation）直到 n=750 才被 bias reduction 补偿。K=4 和 K=8 在 moderate\n      regime 下 2000 labels 内永远达不到 crossover——variance explosion 太严重，16 或 64 个 cell\n      分不到足够 labels。这直接打击 \"as few as 250 expert labels\" 的 headline。只有 extreme\n      regime + K=2 的 crossover 在 350 处，但 extreme regime 在 real data 上不存在（exp-003）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: Budget Crossover Analysis\"\n        columns: [K, regime, crossover_n, ec_hte_rmse_at_crossover, global_rmse_at_crossover]\n        rows:\n          - [2, extreme, 350, 0.032, 0.032]\n          - [2, moderate, 750, 0.024, 0.024]\n          - [2, homogeneous, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [4, extreme, 650, 0.045, 0.045]\n          - [4, moderate, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [8, extreme, 1200, 0.068, 0.068]\n          - [8, moderate, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs n_expert，separate panels for K=2/4/8，lines for EC-HTE vs Global。K=2 curves cross; K≥4 moderate regime curves don't cross。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sensitivity 是 worst 档的另一个 pain point。EC-HTE 在 realistic settings 下需要\n      大量 expert labels 才能 justify——这与 \"reduce expert labeling burden\" 的叙事矛盾。\n      论文需要诚实报告：EC-HTE 是 insurance policy，只在高 heterogeneity 时 pay off，\n      且 cost 随 K 快速增长。建议将 K=2 作为主结果，K≥4 放 appendix 并讨论 limitations。\n\n  - name: \"PPCI Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      PPCI (Sui et al., 2026) kernel-based conditional correction vs EC-HTE，\n      covariate-side vs outcome-side error，composition 实验。\n    expected_results:\n      ppci_bias_on_covariate_error_setting: 0.45\n      echte_bias_on_covariate_error_setting: 0.08\n      ppci_bias_on_outcome_error_setting: 0.05\n      echte_bias_on_outcome_error_setting: 0.42\n      ppci_bias_on_both_errors: 0.38\n      echte_bias_on_both_errors: 0.35\n      composed_ppci_then_echte_bias: 0.22\n      composed_echte_then_ppci_bias: 0.25\n      ppci_partial_effectiveness_on_covariate_error: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPCI 设计上处理 outcome-side measurement error，但 kernel localization 在 covariate-side\n      error 上也有 partial effectiveness（bias 0.45 vs no-correction 的 ~1.0）。原因：PPCI 的\n      kernel 在 covariate space 做 local correction，当 covariate error 与 outcome error 相关时\n      （在 LLM annotation 中常见——同一个 LLM 标注 covariate 和 outcome），PPCI 间接 pick up 了\n      一些 covariate-side correction。这削弱了 EC-HTE 的 differentiation story——reviewer 会说\n      \"PPCI 已经部分解决了你的问题\"。Composition（先 EC-HTE 后 PPCI）有改善但不是 additive——\n      double correction 引入 over-adjustment。differentiation 不是 clean binary，而是 messy spectrum。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 11: EC-HTE vs PPCI Head-to-Head\"\n        columns: [error_type, metric, ppci, echte, composed, no_correction]\n        rows:\n          - [covariate-only, max_subgroup_bias, 0.45, 0.08, \"-\", 1.00]\n          - [outcome-only, max_subgroup_bias, 0.05, 0.42, \"-\", 1.00]\n          - [both, max_subgroup_bias, 0.38, 0.35, 0.22, 1.00]\n          - [covariate-only, coverage, 0.82, 0.87, \"-\", 0.72]\n          - [outcome-only, coverage, 0.91, 0.78, \"-\", 0.72]\n          - [both, coverage, 0.80, 0.83, 0.85, 0.68]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: bias by error type × method。covariate-only 场景 EC-HTE 明显优于 PPCI，但 PPCI 不是零——partial effectiveness 清晰可见。\"\n      - \"Venn diagram style schematic: EC-HTE 和 PPCI 各自的 coverage domain 有 overlap，不是 clean separation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPCI 在 covariate-error 场景的 partial effectiveness（bias 降 55%）是 worst 档的关键\n      complication。论文不能说 \"PPCI 解决不了我们的问题\"，只能说 \"EC-HTE 在 covariate-error 上\n      更优（bias 0.08 vs 0.45），但 PPCI 也有效果\"。Composition 实验提供了一些 value-add（0.22\n      < min(0.38, 0.35)），可以作为 \"combined framework\" 的 positive result，但不是 dramatic。\n      建议在论文中诚实画出 overlap，用 \"complementary but partially overlapping\" framing。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-LLM Annotator Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-4.1 vs Qwen3-235B vs Claude Sonnet 4.6，测量 misclassification heterogeneity 差异。\n      寻找触发显著 heterogeneity 的 LLM/domain 组合。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_max_min_ratio: 1.12\n      qwen3_max_min_ratio: 1.18\n      claude_sonnet_max_min_ratio: 1.10\n      gpt4_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 22\n      qwen3_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 38\n      claude_sonnet_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 18\n      qwen3_specific_subgroup_with_high_error: \"refugee_female_low_education\"\n      qwen3_high_error_subgroup_accuracy: 0.71\n      qwen3_low_error_subgroup_accuracy: 0.89\n      qwen3_specific_case_bias_amplification: 1.45\n      correlation_llm_quality_vs_heterogeneity: -0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frontier LLMs（GPT-4.1, Claude Sonnet）的 heterogeneity 低（ratio ~1.10–1.12），因为\n      这些模型在 political text 上广泛训练过，subgroup 间差异被高 capacity 压平。Qwen3 稍高\n      （1.18）但仍 modest。有趣的发现是 Qwen3 在 specific intersectional subgroup（refugee ×\n      female × low education，语言最复杂）上 accuracy 显著低（0.71 vs 平均 0.82），创造了一个\n      局部的 high heterogeneity case（max/min 在这对 subgroups 间可达 1.25）。但这只在 finest\n      granularity 出现，overall K=2 或 K=4 水平上被平均掉。LLM quality vs heterogeneity 的\n      negative correlation（-0.85）暗示随着 LLM 进步问题会 further diminish。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 12: Cross-LLM Misclassification Heterogeneity\"\n        columns: [llm, overall_acc, max_min_ratio_k2, max_min_ratio_k4, ec_hte_benefit_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4.1, 0.88, 1.12, 1.08, 22]\n          - [Qwen3-235B, 0.82, 1.18, 1.15, 38]\n          - [Claude Sonnet 4.6, 0.90, 1.10, 1.07, 18]\n      - title: \"Table 13: Qwen3 Subgroup-Level Accuracy (Best Case for Heterogeneity)\"\n        columns: [subgroup, n, accuracy, se]\n        rows:\n          - [refugee_female_low_edu, 85, 0.71, 0.049]\n          - [refugee_female_high_edu, 120, 0.80, 0.037]\n          - [refugee_male, 180, 0.83, 0.028]\n          - [host_female, 165, 0.87, 0.026]\n          - [host_male, 150, 0.89, 0.026]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LLM overall accuracy (x) vs max/min heterogeneity ratio (y)。三个点 + trend line，clear negative slope。\"\n      - \"Subgroup accuracy profile per LLM。Qwen3 在 refugee_female_low_edu 有明显 dip。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008 的 silver lining：Qwen3 × refugee_female_low_edu 是一个 genuine case study，\n      可以用来说 \"问题在特定 LLM/domain 组合下确实存在\"。但 sample size 太小（n=85）导致\n      accuracy SE 大（0.049），reviewer 可能质疑 heterogeneity 的 statistical significance。\n      negative correlation 发现是 double-edged：对 field 是好消息（LLM 越好问题越小），\n      对论文是坏消息（motivation weakens over time）。建议在论文中用这个 case study\n      作为 \"illustrative example of when EC-HTE matters\"，同时诚实讨论 trend。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive Expert Annotation Allocation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      CATE-weighted allocation vs uniform vs uncertainty-only，在 fixed expert budget 下\n      优化 subgroup CATE estimation precision。\n    expected_results:\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n250: 12\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n500: 8\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n1000: 4\n      adaptive_vs_uncertainty_only_reduction_pct_n250: 5\n      adaptive_coverage_n250: 0.86\n      uniform_coverage_n250: 0.84\n      optimal_allocation_concentration_gini: 0.35\n      runtime_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      Adaptive allocation 在 worst 档下有 moderate 效果。CATE-weighting 在 n=250 时带来 12%\n      RMSE reduction vs uniform——这是因为即使 overall heterogeneity 不大，将 budget 集中在\n      high-CATE × high-error subgroups 仍然 reduces 最大 bottleneck。但 improvement 随 n 增大\n      快速衰减（n=1000 时仅 4%），因为 uniform allocation 在大 budget 下已经 adequate。\n      与 uncertainty-only allocation 相比优势更小（5%），因为在 worst 档下 CATE heterogeneity\n      和 error heterogeneity 的 correlation 弱——uncertainty-only 已经 capture 了大部分 signal。\n      Coverage 微弱改善。Runtime overhead 高（180%），因为需要 pilot estimates。\n      这不足以作为论文 pivot 的主贡献——improvement 太小且仅在 small n 显著。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 14: Adaptive Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [n_expert, method, rmse, coverage, runtime_sec]\n        rows:\n          - [250, uniform, 0.048, 0.84, 12]\n          - [250, uncertainty_only, 0.045, 0.85, 28]\n          - [250, cate_weighted, 0.042, 0.86, 34]\n          - [500, uniform, 0.032, 0.87, 12]\n          - [500, cate_weighted, 0.029, 0.88, 35]\n          - [1000, uniform, 0.021, 0.90, 12]\n          - [1000, cate_weighted, 0.020, 0.90, 36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs n_expert for three allocation strategies。curves converge as n grows。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive allocation 不够 dramatic 作为 pivot target（Angle C 不可行除非效果更大）。\n      但 12% improvement at n=250 可以作为 \"practical tip\" 放在论文中，不需要是 main contribution。\n      建议保留在 appendix 作为 extension，不投入更多 effort。\n\n  - name: \"Robustness to Misspecified Subgroups\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      EC-HTE 在 subgroup structure noisy/overlapping 或与 true structure 不 aligned 时的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      echte_rmse_correct_subgroups: 0.035\n      echte_rmse_noisy_subgroups_10pct_noise: 0.038\n      echte_rmse_noisy_subgroups_30pct_noise: 0.048\n      echte_rmse_misaligned_subgroups: 0.055\n      global_rmse_misaligned_subgroups: 0.042\n      echte_worse_than_global_at_noise_pct: 25\n      hb_shrinkage_at_30pct_noise: 0.72\n      hb_recovery_vs_mle_at_30pct_noise_pct: 8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Subgroup misspecification 对 EC-HTE 的打击比对 global 更大——因为 EC-HTE 依赖 subgroup\n      structure 来 estimate per-group confusion matrices，而 global 对 subgroup 定义 robust\n      by construction。在 10% noise 下降幅小（8%），但 30% noise 下 EC-HTE RMSE 增加 37%，\n      且在 25% noise 处 EC-HTE 反转为 worse than global。Misaligned subgroups（true heterogeneity\n      沿 dimension A，correction 沿 dimension B）更严重——EC-HTE 比 global 差 31%。HB partial\n      pooling 在高 noise 下确实 shrink toward global（shrinkage 0.72），部分 mitigate 了问题\n      （比 MLE stratified 好 8%），但不够 fully recover。这暴露了 EC-HTE 的 Achilles heel：\n      需要 correct subgroup specification，而在实践中这可能需要 domain expertise。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 15: Robustness to Subgroup Misspecification\"\n        columns: [condition, echte_hb_rmse, echte_mle_rmse, global_rmse, echte_vs_global_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [correct subgroups, 0.035, 0.036, 0.040, \"-12.5%\"]\n          - [10% noise, 0.038, 0.040, 0.040, \"-5.0%\"]\n          - [20% noise, 0.042, 0.046, 0.040, \"+5.0%\"]\n          - [30% noise, 0.048, 0.054, 0.040, \"+20.0%\"]\n          - [misaligned subgroups, 0.055, 0.062, 0.042, \"+31.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs noise level，EC-HTE (HB) / EC-HTE (MLE) / Global。crossover at ~25% noise clearly visible。\"\n      - \"Shrinkage factor vs noise level for HB。monotonically increasing toward 1.0 (= global)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 结果对 worst 档有 mixed implications。Negative：EC-HTE 不是 \"never worse than\n      global\"——在 misspecified subgroups 下可以更差。Positive：HB partial pooling 的 adaptive\n      shrinkage 确实在 work，只是不够 fully salvage。论文必须讨论这个 limitation 并建议\n      practitioners 用 diagnostic criterion + domain knowledge 验证 subgroup choice。\n      这也 weakens Claim 2 的 \"applicable to any CATE estimator\" 部分——需要加 caveat。\n\n  - name: \"Causal Forest Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      EC-HTE post-hoc correction on CausalForestDML leaf-level estimates，\n      vs naive forest vs globally-corrected forest。\n    expected_results:\n      echte_forest_rmse: 0.038\n      global_forest_rmse: 0.036\n      naive_forest_rmse: 0.045\n      echte_forest_coverage: 0.85\n      global_forest_coverage: 0.83\n      naive_forest_coverage: 0.75\n      echte_forest_vs_global_improvement_pct: -5.6\n      variance_adjusted_ci_width_ratio: 1.35\n      leaf_level_correction_convergence_rate: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      Causal forest integration 在 worst 档下表现差于 global correction。原因：forest 的 leaf\n      已经是数据驱动的 subgroups，与手工定义的 correction subgroups 不 aligned。Leaf-level\n      correction 每个 leaf 的 sample size 太小（典型 50–200 observations），confusion matrix\n      估计 noisy，variance inflation（CI width +35%）抵消了 bias reduction。Global correction\n      在 forest setting 下更 robust——forest 自身的 adaptive partitioning 已经 partially\n      account for heterogeneity。EC-HTE 的 RMSE 反而比 global 高 5.6%。收敛率只有 78%（22%\n      的 MC runs 中 leaf-level correction 的 matrix inversion 出现 numerical issues）。\n      这意味着 Claim 2 的 \"causal forest integration\" 部分在 worst 档下 fails。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 16: Causal Forest Integration Results\"\n        columns: [method, rmse, bias, coverage, ci_width_mean, convergence_rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Naive Forest, 0.045, 0.032, 0.75, 0.08, 1.00]\n          - [Global-Corrected Forest, 0.036, 0.018, 0.83, 0.10, 1.00]\n          - [EC-HTE Forest (leaf-level), 0.038, 0.012, 0.85, 0.135, 0.78]\n          - [EC-HTE Forest (subgroup-level), 0.037, 0.015, 0.84, 0.12, 0.95]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bias-variance decomposition bar chart: EC-HTE forest 的 bias 低但 variance 高，net RMSE 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Causal forest integration 不是可行的 pivot direction（Angle C fails for exp-011）。\n      Leaf-level correction 的 variance-bias tradeoff 不利，convergence issues 更是 red flag。\n      Subgroup-level correction applied to forest（而非 leaf-level）表现稍好（RMSE 0.037 vs 0.036），\n      接近 global 但没有 clear win。建议在论文中不把 forest integration 作为 contribution，\n      仅在 discussion 中提到 \"straightforward extension exists but requires careful variance management\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10316,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10316},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d2bdcbf-6297-4483-8c11-07e563a25463","uuid":"9b9dbbce-ce09-4832-b7b9-9bc55b02ac26"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":242694,"duration_api_ms":244256,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  放弃 \"bias mechanism is practically consequential\" 的强叙事。核心发现：当前主流 LLM 在 typical CSS 任务上\n  misclassification heterogeneity 有限（max/min ratio 多在 1.05–1.15），global correction 的额外 bias\n  通常 < 2x，不构成实际危害。转向 Angle A（negative/cautionary result）：首次形式化了 \"何时需要担心\" 的条件，\n  证明当前 LLM 多数情况下不触发，这本身有理论和实践价值。备选 pivot：若 exp-008 找到某个 LLM/domain 组合确实\n  触发显著 heterogeneity，以 case study 挽救叙事；若 exp-009 或 exp-011 意外表现好，pivot 到 adaptive\n  allocation 或 causal forest integration 作为主贡献。关键操作：exp-010（robustness）和 exp-008（multi-LLM）\n  提升优先级，寻找触发条件；将 analytic bound 从 \"tight characterization\" 降级为 \"conservative sufficient\n  condition\"；论文标题改为问句形式（\"When Does Subgroup-Stratified Correction Matter for LLM-Annotated HTE?\"）。\n  仍冲 EMNLP main CL+CSS track，但需 8 页中拿出 1.5 页做 characterization + negative result 的 framing。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"HB EC-HTE Synthetic Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      HB Dirichlet partial pooling vs MLE/Laplace stratified correction，\n      full regime sweep (extreme/moderate/homogeneous × n_expert 100–2000 × K=2,4)。\n    expected_results:\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_extreme_k2_n250: -0.02\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_extreme_k2_n1000: -0.01\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_moderate_k2_n250: 0.00\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_moderate_k4_n250: 0.03\n      hb_rmse_vs_mle_homogeneous_k2_n250: 0.01\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n250: 0.86\n      hb_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n1000: 0.91\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_k2_n250: 0.84\n      hb_coverage_95ci_moderate_k4_n250: 0.83\n      hb_coverage_95ci_homogeneous_k2_n250: 0.88\n      mle_coverage_95ci_extreme_k2_n250: 0.82\n      mle_coverage_95ci_moderate_k4_n250: 0.79\n      partial_pooling_shrinkage_factor_moderate_k4: 0.65\n      mcmc_rhat_max: 1.003\n      mcmc_ess_min: 280\n      mcmc_runtime_vs_mle_ratio: 45.0\n      mc_runs: 1000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst 档下 HB 与 MLE stratified 差异不显著。原因：partial pooling 的价值在于 borrowing strength\n      across subgroups，但当 heterogeneity 本身不大时，MLE stratified 估计已经足够准确，Dirichlet prior\n      的 shrinkage 几乎无事可做。在 extreme regime（人造的 5x+ heterogeneity）下 HB 略优（RMSE 降 2%），\n      但这个 regime 在 realistic 数据上不出现。moderate regime 下差异 < 1%。K=4 时 HB 反而略差（+3%），\n      因为 Dirichlet 的 4×4 confusion matrix 参数空间更大，prior 选择更敏感，且 n_expert=250 时\n      每 cell 样本不足。Coverage 系统性偏低（83–88%），源于 confusion matrix 估计的 sampling\n      uncertainty 未被充分传播到 CATE CI 中——posterior predictive intervals 低估了矩阵逆运算\n      中的 error propagation。MCMC 收敛良好但 runtime 是 MLE 的 45 倍，reviewer 会质疑实用性。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 1: HB vs MLE Stratified — RMSE and Coverage by Regime\"\n        columns: [regime, K, n_expert, rmse_hb, rmse_mle, rmse_diff_pct, coverage_hb, coverage_mle]\n        rows:\n          - [extreme, 2, 250, 0.041, 0.042, \"-2.4%\", 0.86, 0.82]\n          - [extreme, 2, 1000, 0.022, 0.022, \"-1.0%\", 0.91, 0.89]\n          - [extreme, 4, 250, 0.058, 0.055, \"+5.5%\", 0.83, 0.80]\n          - [moderate, 2, 250, 0.035, 0.035, \"0.0%\", 0.84, 0.83]\n          - [moderate, 2, 1000, 0.019, 0.019, \"0.0%\", 0.90, 0.89]\n          - [moderate, 4, 250, 0.049, 0.048, \"+2.1%\", 0.83, 0.79]\n          - [homogeneous, 2, 250, 0.030, 0.030, \"+1.0%\", 0.88, 0.87]\n          - [homogeneous, 4, 250, 0.038, 0.037, \"+2.7%\", 0.85, 0.84]\n      - title: \"Table 2: MCMC Diagnostics Summary\"\n        columns: [parameter_group, rhat_median, rhat_max, ess_bulk_min, ess_tail_min, runtime_sec]\n        rows:\n          - [confusion_matrix_k2, 1.001, 1.003, 450, 280, 42]\n          - [confusion_matrix_k4, 1.002, 1.005, 320, 210, 185]\n          - [cate_posterior_k2, 1.001, 1.002, 520, 310, \"-\"]\n          - [cate_posterior_k4, 1.002, 1.004, 380, 240, \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: HB vs MLE RMSE difference with 95% CI across all regimes. 大多数 CI 跨零，仅 extreme/K=2 显著。\"\n      - \"Coverage calibration plot: nominal 95% vs actual coverage by regime. 系统性低于 nominal line，K=4 更严重。\"\n    analysis: >\n      HB partial pooling 在 worst 档下不是 selling point。extreme regime 的微弱优势无法外推到\n      realistic 数据。Coverage 偏低是结构性问题——需要 bootstrap 或 sandwich variance 补救，\n      但这会进一步增加计算成本。论文中应诚实报告 HB 的边际价值有限，将贡献重心转向 bias mechanism\n      的 characterization 而非 estimation method。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bias Bound Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      解析推导 bias = f(Δπ, Δτ)，K=2 和 K>2 两种情况。\n      MC 验证 analytic prediction vs empirical bias 的 R²。\n    expected_results:\n      analytic_r_squared_k2: 0.92\n      analytic_r_squared_k4: 0.68\n      analytic_r_squared_k8: 0.52\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k2: 1.15\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k4: 2.30\n      bound_tightness_ratio_k8: 3.80\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p05: 1.08\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p10: 1.18\n      bias_amplification_at_realistic_delta_pi_0p20: 1.45\n      bias_amplification_at_extreme_delta_pi_0p40: 3.20\n      debiasing_hurts_threshold_delta_pi: 0.08\n      mc_ci_width_bias_estimate: 0.003\n    result_rationale: >\n      K=2 时 Δπ×Δτ 形式是 exact（R²=0.92，残差来自 finite-sample noise），因为二分类 confusion\n      matrix 只有一个自由度，bias 表达式可以 closed-form 展开。但 K>2 时 confusion matrix 是\n      K×K，交叉项爆炸——K=4 有 12 个 off-diagonal 元素，Δπ×Δτ 的简单乘积形式只是 first-order\n      approximation，忽略了 cross-subgroup misclassification 的高阶交互。R² 从 0.92（K=2）\n      降到 0.68（K=4）再到 0.52（K=8），bound 变得越来越松（tightness ratio 从 1.15 到 3.8）。\n      在 realistic Δπ 范围（0.05–0.10，对应 LLM 在不同 subgroup 间 5–10pp 的 accuracy 差异），\n      bias amplification 仅 1.08–1.18x，不构成实际危害。只有在 Δπ≥0.20 时才开始显著（1.45x），\n      而这个水平在当前 LLM 上很少见。\"Debiasing can hurt\" 的 threshold 虽然存在（Δπ≈0.08），\n      但 hurt 的程度很小。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 3: Analytic Bound Accuracy by K\"\n        columns: [K, r_squared, bound_tightness_ratio, n_mc_runs]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 0.92, 1.15, 1000]\n          - [4, 0.68, 2.30, 1000]\n          - [8, 0.52, 3.80, 500]\n      - title: \"Table 4: Bias Amplification (Global/No-Correction) by Δπ\"\n        columns: [delta_pi, delta_tau, bias_amplification_k2, bias_amplification_k4]\n        rows:\n          - [0.05, 0.3, 1.08, 1.12]\n          - [0.10, 0.3, 1.18, 1.25]\n          - [0.20, 0.3, 1.45, 1.62]\n          - [0.40, 0.3, 3.20, 4.10]\n          - [0.05, 0.6, 1.15, 1.20]\n          - [0.10, 0.6, 1.35, 1.48]\n          - [0.20, 0.6, 2.10, 2.55]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: Δπ (x-axis) × Δτ (y-axis)，color = bias amplification ratio。realistic region（Δπ<0.15, Δτ<0.4）颜色浅（<1.5x），仅右上角极端区域显著。\"\n      - \"Scatter: analytic predicted bias vs MC observed bias，K=2 紧密聚集在 y=x，K=4 散点明显偏离，K=8 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Δπ×Δτ bound 在 K=2 时优雅且 tight，但 generalization 到 K>2 失败——这是 worst 档的\n      核心问题。论文不能宣称 \"通用诊断准则\"，只能说 \"K=2 的 exact characterization + K>2 的\n      conservative sufficient condition\"。Realistic parameter 区间内 bias amplification 太小，\n      \"debiasing can hurt by 5–10x\" 的 headline 只在人造 extreme regime 成立。需要 reframe：\n      \"我们证明了在何种条件下问题才会严重，并发现当前 LLM 通常不触发这些条件。\"\n\n  - name: \"Semi-Synthetic Benchmark\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      Real tweet corpus + injected CATE structure + GPT-4.1/Qwen3-235B 标注。\n      测量 real misclassification heterogeneity，EC-HTE vs global vs no-correction。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.12\n      qwen3_misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.18\n      gpt4_overall_accuracy: 0.88\n      qwen3_overall_accuracy: 0.82\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_reduction_vs_global_gpt4: 0.25\n      ec_hte_subgroup_bias_reduction_vs_global_qwen3: 0.40\n      global_vs_nocorrection_bias_amplification_gpt4: 1.05\n      global_vs_nocorrection_bias_amplification_qwen3: 1.12\n      ec_hte_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.87\n      ec_hte_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.85\n      global_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.85\n      global_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.82\n      nocorrection_coverage_95ci_gpt4: 0.78\n      nocorrection_coverage_95ci_qwen3: 0.74\n      max_subgroup_bias_global_gpt4: 0.015\n      max_subgroup_bias_global_qwen3: 0.028\n      max_subgroup_bias_echte_gpt4: 0.011\n      max_subgroup_bias_echte_qwen3: 0.017\n    result_rationale: >\n      Real LLM 数据上 misclassification heterogeneity 远低于 synthetic extreme regime。\n      GPT-4.1 accuracy 高（88%）且跨 subgroup 差异小（max/min ratio 1.12），因为 frontier LLM\n      在 political text 分类上已经足够好，不同 subgroup 的语言难度差异被模型能力压平。Qwen3 稍差\n      （82%, ratio 1.18），但仍远低于 \"5x\" 的 extreme 设定。结果：global correction 几乎不 hurt\n      （amplification 1.05–1.12x），EC-HTE 的 bias reduction 有但幅度小（25–40%），绝对 bias\n      差异在 0.004–0.011 之间——统计上可能显著但实际上微不足道。Coverage 偏低延续了 exp-001 的\n      pattern。这个结果直接动摇 Claim 1 的 \"practically consequential\" 部分。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 5: Misclassification Heterogeneity — Real LLM on Semi-Synthetic Data\"\n        columns: [llm, overall_acc, subgroup_acc_min, subgroup_acc_max, max_min_ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4.1, 0.88, 0.86, 0.90, 1.12]\n          - [Qwen3-235B, 0.82, 0.78, 0.86, 1.18]\n      - title: \"Table 6: Subgroup CATE Bias (Max Across Subgroups)\"\n        columns: [method, gpt4_max_bias, gpt4_mean_bias, qwen3_max_bias, qwen3_mean_bias]\n        rows:\n          - [No Correction, 0.025, 0.018, 0.042, 0.030]\n          - [Global Correction, 0.015, 0.010, 0.028, 0.019]\n          - [EC-HTE (MLE), 0.012, 0.008, 0.018, 0.012]\n          - [EC-HTE (HB), 0.011, 0.008, 0.017, 0.011]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: subgroup-level bias by method × LLM。差异可见但绝对值都很小。需要 zoom-in panel 才能看到差异。\"\n      - \"Misclassification rate heatmap by subgroup × LLM。颜色变化平缓，heterogeneity 视觉上不突出。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Semi-synthetic 结果是 worst 档叙事的核心证据：real LLM 的 misclassification heterogeneity\n      不足以让 global correction 失效。EC-HTE 有微弱优势但 \"insurance, not necessity\"。\n      论文 framing 必须转向 Angle A：\"好消息是当前 LLM 通常不触发这个问题\"。\n      Qwen3 比 GPT-4.1 heterogeneity 略大，暗示 weaker LLMs 可能在某些 domain 触发——\n      这为 exp-008 寻找 stronger case 提供方向。\n\n  - name: \"Ashwin et al. Real-Data Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-004\"\n    description: >\n      Rohingya refugee interview 数据，LLM 标注 error 与 refugee status/gender/education 相关。\n      EC-HTE vs global correction on real CATEs。\n    expected_results:\n      misclass_heterogeneity_max_min_ratio: 1.22\n      ec_hte_cate_shift_vs_global_max_subgroup: 0.035\n      ec_hte_cate_shift_vs_global_mean: 0.018\n      ec_hte_coverage: 0.86\n      global_coverage: 0.83\n      nocorrection_coverage: 0.76\n      bias_amplification_global_vs_nocorrection: 1.15\n      qualitative_conclusion_changes: 0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ashwin et al. 数据的优势是 known demographic-correlated error，但 refugee interview text\n      的 LLM 分类难度差异（按 refugee status/gender）可能只是 moderate。max/min ratio 1.22 比\n      semi-synthetic 高一些（因为 code-switching、方言、文化特定表达确实影响 LLM），但仍不到\n      dramatic 的程度。EC-HTE 的 CATE 调整量（0.035）虽然比 semi-synthetic 大，但没有改变任何\n      subgroup 的 qualitative conclusion（即哪个 subgroup 的 treatment effect 更大的排序不变）。\n      这意味着 EC-HTE 在实际决策层面没有 impact。Coverage 稍好于 semi-synthetic 但仍低于 nominal。\n      无 ground truth CATE 导致无法计算 bias——只能报告 \"correction shift\"，reviewer 可能质疑\n      这是 improvement 还是 overcorrection。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 7: Ashwin et al. — Misclassification by Subgroup\"\n        columns: [subgroup, n, llm_accuracy, accuracy_se]\n        rows:\n          - [female_refugee, 420, 0.78, 0.020]\n          - [male_refugee, 380, 0.82, 0.020]\n          - [female_host, 350, 0.88, 0.017]\n          - [male_host, 310, 0.90, 0.017]\n      - title: \"Table 8: CATE Estimates by Method\"\n        columns: [subgroup, cate_nocorr, cate_global, cate_echte, shift_global_to_echte]\n        rows:\n          - [female_refugee, 0.142, 0.158, 0.172, 0.014]\n          - [male_refugee, 0.118, 0.131, 0.138, 0.007]\n          - [female_host, 0.085, 0.094, 0.090, -0.004]\n          - [male_host, 0.062, 0.069, 0.065, -0.004]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Point-range plot: CATE estimates with 95% CI by method per subgroup。CI 大量重叠，shift 在 CI 内。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Real data 上 EC-HTE 有方向性的 correction 但幅度不足以改变结论。没有 ground truth 是致命\n      弱点——无法证明 EC-HTE 更接近 truth 还是引入了 overcorrection。论文只能定性地论证\n      \"stratified correction 的方向与 known error patterns 一致\"。作为 supporting evidence\n      可以放在论文中，但不能作为 standalone claim 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Criterion Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      Δπ×Δτ product 作为 diagnostic，ROC 分析预测 \"global correction harmful\" 的准确性。\n    expected_results:\n      diagnostic_auc_k2: 0.74\n      diagnostic_auc_k4: 0.65\n      diagnostic_auc_overall: 0.70\n      optimal_threshold_delta_pi_times_delta_tau: 0.025\n      sensitivity_at_fpr_0p10: 0.52\n      specificity_at_tpr_0p90: 0.35\n      fraction_settings_where_global_harmful: 0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Diagnostic AUC 受限于两个因素。(1) \"Global correction harmful\" 的 base rate 低（仅 18%\n      的 settings 触发），因为 realistic parameter 空间中 Δπ 和 Δτ 都倾向于小值——大多数时候\n      global correction 是 fine 的。低 base rate 让 classifier 难以 distinguish。(2) K>2 时\n      Δπ×Δτ 本身就不是好的 summary statistic（exp-002 已证明），sum-of-products 形式有 information\n      loss。AUC=0.70 意味着 diagnostic 比随机好但远不够 reliable——sensitivity 和 specificity\n      无法同时高。作为 \"practical tool\" 推荐给用户是勉强的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 9: Diagnostic ROC Summary\"\n        columns: [setting, auc, sensitivity_at_fpr10, specificity_at_tpr90, n_settings]\n        rows:\n          - [K=2 synthetic, 0.74, 0.58, 0.42, 500]\n          - [K=4 synthetic, 0.65, 0.45, 0.28, 500]\n          - [semi-synthetic (GPT-4.1), 0.71, 0.50, 0.33, 100]\n          - [semi-synthetic (Qwen3), 0.73, 0.55, 0.38, 100]\n          - [overall, 0.70, 0.52, 0.35, 1200]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"ROC curves by K value。K=2 曲线偏离 diagonal 但远未达到左上角。K=4 接近 diagonal。\"\n      - \"Calibration plot: predicted probability vs actual fraction where global harmful。underconfident in middle range。\"\n    analysis: >\n      AUC < 0.75 意味着 Claim 3（diagnostic criterion）作为 standalone contribution 失败。\n      不能推荐给 practitioners 说 \"用这个判断是否需要 stratified correction\"。但问题的 formalization\n      本身仍有价值——\"什么情况下应该担心\" 的问题此前无人提出。论文中 reframe 为 \"we provide a\n      conservative sufficient condition, not a precise diagnostic\"：如果 Δπ×Δτ > threshold，\n      一定要用 stratified；如果 < threshold，大概率 safe 但不保证。这在 Angle A 叙事下 work。\n\n  - name: \"Expert Label Budget Sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      n_expert sweep {50, 100, 250, 500, 1000, 2000} × K ∈ {2, 4, 8}，\n      找 EC-HTE > Global 的 crossover point。\n    expected_results:\n      crossover_n_k2_moderate: 750\n      crossover_n_k4_moderate: \"never (within 2000)\"\n      crossover_n_k2_extreme: 350\n      crossover_n_k8_moderate: \"never (within 2000)\"\n      hb_advantage_at_n250_k2_moderate_rmse_pct: -1.5\n      hb_advantage_at_n250_k4_moderate_rmse_pct: +4.0\n      hb_advantage_at_n1000_k2_moderate_rmse_pct: -0.5\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.095\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n100_k2: 0.068\n      ec_hte_rmse_at_n2000_k2: 0.018\n      global_rmse_at_n50_k2: 0.052\n      global_rmse_at_n2000_k2: 0.019\n    result_rationale: >\n      Crossover point 高（500–1000 range）因为 EC-HTE 需要足够 per-subgroup expert labels 来\n      估计 K×K confusion matrix——K=2 时每个 cell 需要 ~50 个 labels 才 stable，意味着总共需要\n      ~200+。但在 moderate heterogeneity 下 global 的 bias 很小，EC-HTE 的 variance cost（来自\n      subgroup-level estimation）直到 n=750 才被 bias reduction 补偿。K=4 和 K=8 在 moderate\n      regime 下 2000 labels 内永远达不到 crossover——variance explosion 太严重，16 或 64 个 cell\n      分不到足够 labels。这直接打击 \"as few as 250 expert labels\" 的 headline。只有 extreme\n      regime + K=2 的 crossover 在 350 处，但 extreme regime 在 real data 上不存在（exp-003）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 10: Budget Crossover Analysis\"\n        columns: [K, regime, crossover_n, ec_hte_rmse_at_crossover, global_rmse_at_crossover]\n        rows:\n          - [2, extreme, 350, 0.032, 0.032]\n          - [2, moderate, 750, 0.024, 0.024]\n          - [2, homogeneous, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [4, extreme, 650, 0.045, 0.045]\n          - [4, moderate, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n          - [8, extreme, 1200, 0.068, 0.068]\n          - [8, moderate, \">2000\", \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs n_expert，separate panels for K=2/4/8，lines for EC-HTE vs Global。K=2 curves cross; K≥4 moderate regime curves don't cross。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Budget sensitivity 是 worst 档的另一个 pain point。EC-HTE 在 realistic settings 下需要\n      大量 expert labels 才能 justify——这与 \"reduce expert labeling burden\" 的叙事矛盾。\n      论文需要诚实报告：EC-HTE 是 insurance policy，只在高 heterogeneity 时 pay off，\n      且 cost 随 K 快速增长。建议将 K=2 作为主结果，K≥4 放 appendix 并讨论 limitations。\n\n  - name: \"PPCI Baseline Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-007\"\n    description: >\n      PPCI (Sui et al., 2026) kernel-based conditional correction vs EC-HTE，\n      covariate-side vs outcome-side error，composition 实验。\n    expected_results:\n      ppci_bias_on_covariate_error_setting: 0.45\n      echte_bias_on_covariate_error_setting: 0.08\n      ppci_bias_on_outcome_error_setting: 0.05\n      echte_bias_on_outcome_error_setting: 0.42\n      ppci_bias_on_both_errors: 0.38\n      echte_bias_on_both_errors: 0.35\n      composed_ppci_then_echte_bias: 0.22\n      composed_echte_then_ppci_bias: 0.25\n      ppci_partial_effectiveness_on_covariate_error: 0.55\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPCI 设计上处理 outcome-side measurement error，但 kernel localization 在 covariate-side\n      error 上也有 partial effectiveness（bias 0.45 vs no-correction 的 ~1.0）。原因：PPCI 的\n      kernel 在 covariate space 做 local correction，当 covariate error 与 outcome error 相关时\n      （在 LLM annotation 中常见——同一个 LLM 标注 covariate 和 outcome），PPCI 间接 pick up 了\n      一些 covariate-side correction。这削弱了 EC-HTE 的 differentiation story——reviewer 会说\n      \"PPCI 已经部分解决了你的问题\"。Composition（先 EC-HTE 后 PPCI）有改善但不是 additive——\n      double correction 引入 over-adjustment。differentiation 不是 clean binary，而是 messy spectrum。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 11: EC-HTE vs PPCI Head-to-Head\"\n        columns: [error_type, metric, ppci, echte, composed, no_correction]\n        rows:\n          - [covariate-only, max_subgroup_bias, 0.45, 0.08, \"-\", 1.00]\n          - [outcome-only, max_subgroup_bias, 0.05, 0.42, \"-\", 1.00]\n          - [both, max_subgroup_bias, 0.38, 0.35, 0.22, 1.00]\n          - [covariate-only, coverage, 0.82, 0.87, \"-\", 0.72]\n          - [outcome-only, coverage, 0.91, 0.78, \"-\", 0.72]\n          - [both, coverage, 0.80, 0.83, 0.85, 0.68]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: bias by error type × method。covariate-only 场景 EC-HTE 明显优于 PPCI，但 PPCI 不是零——partial effectiveness 清晰可见。\"\n      - \"Venn diagram style schematic: EC-HTE 和 PPCI 各自的 coverage domain 有 overlap，不是 clean separation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPCI 在 covariate-error 场景的 partial effectiveness（bias 降 55%）是 worst 档的关键\n      complication。论文不能说 \"PPCI 解决不了我们的问题\"，只能说 \"EC-HTE 在 covariate-error 上\n      更优（bias 0.08 vs 0.45），但 PPCI 也有效果\"。Composition 实验提供了一些 value-add（0.22\n      < min(0.38, 0.35)），可以作为 \"combined framework\" 的 positive result，但不是 dramatic。\n      建议在论文中诚实画出 overlap，用 \"complementary but partially overlapping\" framing。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-LLM Annotator Comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-4.1 vs Qwen3-235B vs Claude Sonnet 4.6，测量 misclassification heterogeneity 差异。\n      寻找触发显著 heterogeneity 的 LLM/domain 组合。\n    expected_results:\n      gpt4_max_min_ratio: 1.12\n      qwen3_max_min_ratio: 1.18\n      claude_sonnet_max_min_ratio: 1.10\n      gpt4_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 22\n      qwen3_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 38\n      claude_sonnet_ec_hte_benefit_bias_reduction_pct: 18\n      qwen3_specific_subgroup_with_high_error: \"refugee_female_low_education\"\n      qwen3_high_error_subgroup_accuracy: 0.71\n      qwen3_low_error_subgroup_accuracy: 0.89\n      qwen3_specific_case_bias_amplification: 1.45\n      correlation_llm_quality_vs_heterogeneity: -0.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      Frontier LLMs（GPT-4.1, Claude Sonnet）的 heterogeneity 低（ratio ~1.10–1.12），因为\n      这些模型在 political text 上广泛训练过，subgroup 间差异被高 capacity 压平。Qwen3 稍高\n      （1.18）但仍 modest。有趣的发现是 Qwen3 在 specific intersectional subgroup（refugee ×\n      female × low education，语言最复杂）上 accuracy 显著低（0.71 vs 平均 0.82），创造了一个\n      局部的 high heterogeneity case（max/min 在这对 subgroups 间可达 1.25）。但这只在 finest\n      granularity 出现，overall K=2 或 K=4 水平上被平均掉。LLM quality vs heterogeneity 的\n      negative correlation（-0.85）暗示随着 LLM 进步问题会 further diminish。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 12: Cross-LLM Misclassification Heterogeneity\"\n        columns: [llm, overall_acc, max_min_ratio_k2, max_min_ratio_k4, ec_hte_benefit_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4.1, 0.88, 1.12, 1.08, 22]\n          - [Qwen3-235B, 0.82, 1.18, 1.15, 38]\n          - [Claude Sonnet 4.6, 0.90, 1.10, 1.07, 18]\n      - title: \"Table 13: Qwen3 Subgroup-Level Accuracy (Best Case for Heterogeneity)\"\n        columns: [subgroup, n, accuracy, se]\n        rows:\n          - [refugee_female_low_edu, 85, 0.71, 0.049]\n          - [refugee_female_high_edu, 120, 0.80, 0.037]\n          - [refugee_male, 180, 0.83, 0.028]\n          - [host_female, 165, 0.87, 0.026]\n          - [host_male, 150, 0.89, 0.026]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: LLM overall accuracy (x) vs max/min heterogeneity ratio (y)。三个点 + trend line，clear negative slope。\"\n      - \"Subgroup accuracy profile per LLM。Qwen3 在 refugee_female_low_edu 有明显 dip。\"\n    analysis: >\n      exp-008 的 silver lining：Qwen3 × refugee_female_low_edu 是一个 genuine case study，\n      可以用来说 \"问题在特定 LLM/domain 组合下确实存在\"。但 sample size 太小（n=85）导致\n      accuracy SE 大（0.049），reviewer 可能质疑 heterogeneity 的 statistical significance。\n      negative correlation 发现是 double-edged：对 field 是好消息（LLM 越好问题越小），\n      对论文是坏消息（motivation weakens over time）。建议在论文中用这个 case study\n      作为 \"illustrative example of when EC-HTE matters\"，同时诚实讨论 trend。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive Expert Annotation Allocation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      CATE-weighted allocation vs uniform vs uncertainty-only，在 fixed expert budget 下\n      优化 subgroup CATE estimation precision。\n    expected_results:\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n250: 12\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n500: 8\n      adaptive_rmse_vs_uniform_reduction_pct_n1000: 4\n      adaptive_vs_uncertainty_only_reduction_pct_n250: 5\n      adaptive_coverage_n250: 0.86\n      uniform_coverage_n250: 0.84\n      optimal_allocation_concentration_gini: 0.35\n      runtime_overhead_vs_uniform_pct: 180\n    result_rationale: >\n      Adaptive allocation 在 worst 档下有 moderate 效果。CATE-weighting 在 n=250 时带来 12%\n      RMSE reduction vs uniform——这是因为即使 overall heterogeneity 不大，将 budget 集中在\n      high-CATE × high-error subgroups 仍然 reduces 最大 bottleneck。但 improvement 随 n 增大\n      快速衰减（n=1000 时仅 4%），因为 uniform allocation 在大 budget 下已经 adequate。\n      与 uncertainty-only allocation 相比优势更小（5%），因为在 worst 档下 CATE heterogeneity\n      和 error heterogeneity 的 correlation 弱——uncertainty-only 已经 capture 了大部分 signal。\n      Coverage 微弱改善。Runtime overhead 高（180%），因为需要 pilot estimates。\n      这不足以作为论文 pivot 的主贡献——improvement 太小且仅在 small n 显著。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 14: Adaptive Allocation Results\"\n        columns: [n_expert, method, rmse, coverage, runtime_sec]\n        rows:\n          - [250, uniform, 0.048, 0.84, 12]\n          - [250, uncertainty_only, 0.045, 0.85, 28]\n          - [250, cate_weighted, 0.042, 0.86, 34]\n          - [500, uniform, 0.032, 0.87, 12]\n          - [500, cate_weighted, 0.029, 0.88, 35]\n          - [1000, uniform, 0.021, 0.90, 12]\n          - [1000, cate_weighted, 0.020, 0.90, 36]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs n_expert for three allocation strategies。curves converge as n grows。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive allocation 不够 dramatic 作为 pivot target（Angle C 不可行除非效果更大）。\n      但 12% improvement at n=250 可以作为 \"practical tip\" 放在论文中，不需要是 main contribution。\n      建议保留在 appendix 作为 extension，不投入更多 effort。\n\n  - name: \"Robustness to Misspecified Subgroups\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-010\"\n    description: >\n      EC-HTE 在 subgroup structure noisy/overlapping 或与 true structure 不 aligned 时的表现。\n    expected_results:\n      echte_rmse_correct_subgroups: 0.035\n      echte_rmse_noisy_subgroups_10pct_noise: 0.038\n      echte_rmse_noisy_subgroups_30pct_noise: 0.048\n      echte_rmse_misaligned_subgroups: 0.055\n      global_rmse_misaligned_subgroups: 0.042\n      echte_worse_than_global_at_noise_pct: 25\n      hb_shrinkage_at_30pct_noise: 0.72\n      hb_recovery_vs_mle_at_30pct_noise_pct: 8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Subgroup misspecification 对 EC-HTE 的打击比对 global 更大——因为 EC-HTE 依赖 subgroup\n      structure 来 estimate per-group confusion matrices，而 global 对 subgroup 定义 robust\n      by construction。在 10% noise 下降幅小（8%），但 30% noise 下 EC-HTE RMSE 增加 37%，\n      且在 25% noise 处 EC-HTE 反转为 worse than global。Misaligned subgroups（true heterogeneity\n      沿 dimension A，correction 沿 dimension B）更严重——EC-HTE 比 global 差 31%。HB partial\n      pooling 在高 noise 下确实 shrink toward global（shrinkage 0.72），部分 mitigate 了问题\n      （比 MLE stratified 好 8%），但不够 fully recover。这暴露了 EC-HTE 的 Achilles heel：\n      需要 correct subgroup specification，而在实践中这可能需要 domain expertise。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 15: Robustness to Subgroup Misspecification\"\n        columns: [condition, echte_hb_rmse, echte_mle_rmse, global_rmse, echte_vs_global_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [correct subgroups, 0.035, 0.036, 0.040, \"-12.5%\"]\n          - [10% noise, 0.038, 0.040, 0.040, \"-5.0%\"]\n          - [20% noise, 0.042, 0.046, 0.040, \"+5.0%\"]\n          - [30% noise, 0.048, 0.054, 0.040, \"+20.0%\"]\n          - [misaligned subgroups, 0.055, 0.062, 0.042, \"+31.0%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: RMSE vs noise level，EC-HTE (HB) / EC-HTE (MLE) / Global。crossover at ~25% noise clearly visible。\"\n      - \"Shrinkage factor vs noise level for HB。monotonically increasing toward 1.0 (= global)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 结果对 worst 档有 mixed implications。Negative：EC-HTE 不是 \"never worse than\n      global\"——在 misspecified subgroups 下可以更差。Positive：HB partial pooling 的 adaptive\n      shrinkage 确实在 work，只是不够 fully salvage。论文必须讨论这个 limitation 并建议\n      practitioners 用 diagnostic criterion + domain knowledge 验证 subgroup choice。\n      这也 weakens Claim 2 的 \"applicable to any CATE estimator\" 部分——需要加 caveat。\n\n  - name: \"Causal Forest Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-011\"\n    description: >\n      EC-HTE post-hoc correction on CausalForestDML leaf-level estimates，\n      vs naive forest vs globally-corrected forest。\n    expected_results:\n      echte_forest_rmse: 0.038\n      global_forest_rmse: 0.036\n      naive_forest_rmse: 0.045\n      echte_forest_coverage: 0.85\n      global_forest_coverage: 0.83\n      naive_forest_coverage: 0.75\n      echte_forest_vs_global_improvement_pct: -5.6\n      variance_adjusted_ci_width_ratio: 1.35\n      leaf_level_correction_convergence_rate: 0.78\n    result_rationale: >\n      Causal forest integration 在 worst 档下表现差于 global correction。原因：forest 的 leaf\n      已经是数据驱动的 subgroups，与手工定义的 correction subgroups 不 aligned。Leaf-level\n      correction 每个 leaf 的 sample size 太小（典型 50–200 observations），confusion matrix\n      估计 noisy，variance inflation（CI width +35%）抵消了 bias reduction。Global correction\n      在 forest setting 下更 robust——forest 自身的 adaptive partitioning 已经 partially\n      account for heterogeneity。EC-HTE 的 RMSE 反而比 global 高 5.6%。收敛率只有 78%（22%\n      的 MC runs 中 leaf-level correction 的 matrix inversion 出现 numerical issues）。\n      这意味着 Claim 2 的 \"causal forest integration\" 部分在 worst 档下 fails。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table 16: Causal Forest Integration Results\"\n        columns: [method, rmse, bias, coverage, ci_width_mean, convergence_rate]\n        rows:\n          - [Naive Forest, 0.045, 0.032, 0.75, 0.08, 1.00]\n          - [Global-Corrected Forest, 0.036, 0.018, 0.83, 0.10, 1.00]\n          - [EC-HTE Forest (leaf-level), 0.038, 0.012, 0.85, 0.135, 0.78]\n          - [EC-HTE Forest (subgroup-level), 0.037, 0.015, 0.84, 0.12, 0.95]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bias-variance decomposition bar chart: EC-HTE forest 的 bias 低但 variance 高，net RMSE 更差。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Causal forest integration 不是可行的 pivot direction（Angle C fails for exp-011）。\n      Leaf-level correction 的 variance-bias tradeoff 不利，convergence issues 更是 red flag。\n      Subgroup-level correction applied to forest（而非 leaf-level）表现稍好（RMSE 0.037 vs 0.036），\n      接近 global 但没有 clear win。建议在论文中不把 forest integration 作为 contribution，\n      仅在 discussion 中提到 \"straightforward extension exists but requires careful variance management\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"2d2bdcbf-6297-4483-8c11-07e563a25463","total_cost_usd":0.4062405,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10316,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":13217,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10316,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13217,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10316,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":10316},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":5290,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.005410000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13217,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":10316,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4008305,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"36f45cf4-1a36-431c-b5b7-287f4f319b39"}
